<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/nsv-registry/Approved%20NSVs-alpha/ACIGD/CDASHIG%20v2.3>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/nsv-registry#Approved%20NSVs-alpha> ;
    nsv:Curator%20Remarks """If going to SDTM may need to have one active ingredient record per variable. This will allow space for the number so that each ingredient for the NSV/SUPPQUAL will have number (e.g. --ACIGD1, --ACIGD2, etc.).\r
\r
The variable was reviewed for CDASHIG v2.2 after publication. During NSV review, the variable was updated and metadata updated including the variable name from INGRD to ACIGRD. The start date for the transition to the new NSV is yet to be determined by the CDASH team.""" ;
    nsv:Define-XML%20Datatype "text" ;
    nsv:Description "The name(s) of the active ingredients used in the medication taken or administered." ;
    nsv:Label "Active Ingredients" ;
    nsv:Limited%20to%20Class%28es%29 "Interventions" ;
    nsv:Notes "This may be collected in addition to the medication/therapy name. Collecting this provides more detailed information when coding to a dictionary; Typically a sponsor would collect the ingredients with commas between the ingredients." ;
    nsv:Role "Non-Standard Variable Qualifier" ;
    nsv:Simple%20Datatype "Char" ;
    nsv:Source%28s%29 "CDASHIG v2.3" ;
    nsv:Status%20of%20the%20NSV%20Review "Approved" ;
    nsv:Variable%20Name "ACIGD" ;
    nsv:XML%20Datatype "string" ;
.

